# supercronic crontab for meta-ads-agents
# Container TZ is America/Sao_Paulo (set in Dockerfile + fly.toml).
# Format: m h dom mon dow command
#
# Generic skills accept client_slug=<slug> as argument.
# Analytics: semanal às segundas 08h BRT (reduz custo ~7x vs diário).
# Criação de campanha: removida do cron — sob demanda via Nexus (evita custo diário desnecessário).
# On-demand jobs: poll a cada minuto via poll-agent-jobs.sh.

# ── Weekly funnel analytics (segunda-feira 08h BRT) ────────────────────────────
# Opção 3: skill verifica gasto nos últimos 7 dias antes de rodar análise completa.
0  8 * * 1 /app/scripts/run-skill.sh funnel-analytics-campaign client_slug=brasdente
1  8 * * 1 /app/scripts/run-skill.sh funnel-analytics-campaign client_slug=bombapatch
2  8 * * 1 /app/scripts/run-skill.sh funnel-analytics-campaign client_slug=bpure
3  8 * * 1 /app/scripts/run-skill.sh funnel-analytics-campaign client_slug=cardsofparadise
4  8 * * 1 /app/scripts/run-skill.sh funnel-analytics-campaign client_slug=clorin
5  8 * * 1 /app/scripts/run-skill.sh funnel-analytics-campaign client_slug=coutinho
6  8 * * 1 /app/scripts/run-skill.sh funnel-analytics-campaign client_slug=dolcevivere
7  8 * * 1 /app/scripts/run-skill.sh funnel-analytics-campaign client_slug=lulibaby
8  8 * * 1 /app/scripts/run-skill.sh funnel-analytics-campaign client_slug=originalflex
9  8 * * 1 /app/scripts/run-skill.sh funnel-analytics-campaign client_slug=piemon
10 8 * * 1 /app/scripts/run-skill.sh funnel-analytics-campaign client_slug=armando

# ── On-demand job queue (Nexus → agent_jobs → runner) ─────────────────────────
# Every minute: claim one pending job enqueued by the Nexus dashboard.
# Single-flight via mkdir lock — see scripts/poll-agent-jobs.sh and ADR 0009.
# Criação e ativação de campanhas: disparadas pelo operador via Nexus voice.
* * * * * /app/scripts/poll-agent-jobs.sh
